        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of February 26, 2026, we owned, operated, programmed or provided sales and other services to 201 full power television stations in 116 markets in 40 states and the District of Columbia, reaching approximately 39% of all U.S.",
