        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are able to achieve economies of scale by leveraging our size and corporate management expertise by providing programming, financial, sales and marketing support to our owned stations, the stations to which we provide services and to other business units.",
